  "releaseNotes": "Release notes look best on GitHub: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/releases/tag/v8.9.0-preview.0\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main -->\n## What's Changed\n### New Features 🎉\n* Authorize app specific API scopes by @martinothamar in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1357\n* Support working with clean data in dataProcessors and validators and removeWhenHidden by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1421\n* Make required messages from backend layouts configurable by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1488\n### Bugfixes 🐛\n* Make [component] lookups work in expression validation by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1497\n* Ensure DataValues and PresentationValues gets updated at every opportunity  by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1496\n* Return http status 400 on request deserialization failiures by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1505\n### Dependency Upgrades 📦\n* Update mcr.microsoft.com/dotnet/sdk:8.0 Docker digest to ff83118 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1502\n* Update github/codeql-action digest to 3599b3b by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1501\n* Update actions/setup-dotnet action to v5 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1491\n* Update actions/cache digest to 0057852 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1490\n* Update actions/github-script action to v8 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1481\n* Update nuget non-major dependencies (patch) by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1479\n* Update nuget non-major dependencies (patch) by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1508\n* Update nuget non-major dependencies (minor) by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1480\n### Other Changes\n* Add .x3d support to MimeTypeMap by @csvenke in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1482\n* Set correct media type on customOpenapi.json by @ivarne in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1516\n## New Contributors\n* @csvenke made their first contribution in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1482\n* @olavsorl made their first contribution in https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/pull/1503\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/Altinn/app-lib-dotnet/compare/v8.8.0...v8.9.0-preview.0",
